                                        "sense_id": "5e113602-6f8d-398d-a289-0afafa6cfdc1",
                                        "entry_id": "8c35d4e1-8e69-3a3e-a976-9bfc69867011",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who participates in a jihad, an Islamic holy war or conflict; a mujahid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44f97598-e4b9-31da-94e8-7850b03f1f03",
                                        "entry_id": "8c35d4e1-8e69-3a3e-a976-9bfc69867011",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An adherent of jihadism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b16eaed1-80d6-314c-a79e-95a999404fc2",
                                        "entry_id": "8c35d4e1-8e69-3a3e-a976-9bfc69867011",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who is militant for their religion (or irreligion)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97fc063b-457d-4f27-a305-eab1b40ef8c5",
                                                "sense_id": "b16eaed1-80d6-314c-a79e-95a999404fc2",
                                                "text": "[…] only a matter of time before Christian jihadists start strapping bombs to their bodies and going off on suicide missions in the name of Jesus Christ."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2526a43-8bd4-4bc0-9900-ced0716c32f6",
                                                "sense_id": "b16eaed1-80d6-314c-a79e-95a999404fc2",
                                                "text": "Like Muslim jihadists, Christian jihadists such as these two are willing to sacrifice as they seek to impose their religious tyranny on others."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99cfde5c-ebd5-4776-9f6c-ee411f67feba",
                                                "sense_id": "b16eaed1-80d6-314c-a79e-95a999404fc2",
                                                "text": "[…] with Christian jihadists wearing bandoliers, waving real weapons, and waging a literal flesh-and-blood incursion against teachers of false religions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7ea303f-b7c2-472c-b420-2a8bd7b62f1e",
                                                "sense_id": "b16eaed1-80d6-314c-a79e-95a999404fc2",
                                                "text": "By the end of the semester, only one radical Jewish jihadist in my study group kept being a racist pig and attacking me personally in section discussions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e8cf567-6470-469b-91c2-55a464fd7940",
                                                "sense_id": "b16eaed1-80d6-314c-a79e-95a999404fc2",
                                                "text": "I was prepared to meet a radical atheist jihadist. Would we brawl right there in my hotel room? I half expected just that."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1dcfb901-1474-4fa0-aa4d-78b16f2e4354",
                                                "sense_id": "b16eaed1-80d6-314c-a79e-95a999404fc2",
                                                "text": "[…] and even later evolved into the Jewish jihadist who wrote the Book of Revelation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
